      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تشاغل عَنْهُ</span></b> : see 1. [Accord. to Golius,
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تشاغلوا</span> signifies <i>They occupied one another,</i> on
the authority of the KL; in which, however, I
find only <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَشَاغُلٌ</span> expl. as meaning <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خودرا بچيزى</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مشغول كردن</span> i. e. <i>To make oneself busied,</i> &amp;c.,
<i>with a thing.</i>]

